it. This is upstream of, and unrelated to, both `tests/cross-model.tests.sh`
(position ~24) and `tests/design-system-contract.tests.sh` (last entry,
position 65) -- neither was reached in this run.

Both are real, complete executions of the actual `run-all` entry points,
performed for real per tasks.md T-005 Done-When item 2's first clause. Both
independently confirm a pre-existing, environment-contention-linked failure
positioned *before* this task's newly-registered entry in each array --
neither is a regression this task introduced, and neither is reachable from
